---
// `docker images` in the post: python:3.13-slim 202MB, clue-api:p12 258MB
// (multi-stage, uid 10001), clue-api:p12-fat 1.7GB (single stage, uid 0).
const W = 900, H = 260;
const MAX = 740, FULL = 1700;
const rows = [
  { y: 60, en: 'python:3.13-slim (the base alone)', vi: 'python:3.13-slim (chỉ riêng base)', mb: 202, label: '202 MB', who: { en: '', vi: '' } },
  { y: 120, en: 'clue-api:p12 (multi-stage)', vi: 'clue-api:p12 (multi-stage)', mb: 258, label: '258 MB', who: { en: 'runs as uid 10001', vi: 'chạy với uid 10001' } },
  { y: 180, en: 'clue-api:p12-fat (one stage)', vi: 'clue-api:p12-fat (một stage)', mb: 1700, label: '1.7 GB', red: true, who: { en: 'runs as uid 0 (root)', vi: 'chạy với uid 0 (root)' } },
];
---
<figure class="bep12d">
  <div class="bep12d-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three horizontal bars of image size from docker images. The Python slim base is 202 megabytes, the multi-stage image is 258 megabytes and runs as user 10001, the single-stage image is 1.7 gigabytes, drawn in red, and runs as root.">
    {rows.map((r) => (
      <g>
        <text x="40" y={r.y - 8} class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi}</tspan></text>
        <rect x="40" y={r.y} width={Math.max(6, (r.mb / FULL) * MAX)} height="22" rx="4" class={r.red ? 'bar red' : 'bar'} />
        <text x={40 + Math.max(6, (r.mb / FULL) * MAX) + 10} y={r.y + 16} class={r.red ? 'val red' : 'val'}><tspan data-lang-en>{r.label}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.label}</tspan></text>
        {r.who.en && <text x={r.red ? 600 : 300} y={r.y - 8} class={r.red ? 'sm red' : 'sm'}><tspan data-lang-en>{r.who.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.who.vi}</tspan></text>}
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="40" y="240" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>bars share one scale; sizes are exactly what docker images printed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>các thanh cùng một thang đo; kích thước đúng như docker images in ra</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The fat image is six and a half times larger than the multi-stage one, and its process is root.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Image fat lớn gấp khoảng sáu lần rưỡi image multi-stage, và process của nó chạy bằng root.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep12d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep12d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep12d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep12d text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep12d .lab { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep12d .val { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep12d .sm { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep12d text.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep12d .bar { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep12d .bar.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep12d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
